@CustomerApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Obtener todos los clientes (ordenados por LastName + FirstName)
GET {{CustomerApi_HostAddress}}/api/customers/
Accept: application/json

### Create new customers
POST {{CustomerApi_HostAddress}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "id": 1,
    "firstName": "Juan",
    "lastName": "Pérez",
    "age": 25
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "firstName": "Ana",
    "lastName": "Gómez",
    "age": 30
  }
]
